  {%- comment -%}
    Byte-match (SCHEMA-CRIT-1): the visible accordion below and the faq_items list passed to
    bbi-faq-jsonld (after the footer) are built from the SAME faq_item blocks. Visible question/answer
    use `| escape`; the snippet serializes the same strings via `| json`. No divergent transforms.
    Block copy must contain neither "||" (the Q/A delimiter) nor "~~~" (the entry delimiter used to
    assemble the list — see below).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign faq_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'faq_item' -%}
  {%- if faq_blocks.size > 0 -%}
  <section class="lp-faq" aria-label="Frequently asked questions">
    <div class="lp-faq__inner">
      <div class="lp-faq__head">
        <p class="lp-faq__eyebrow bbi-mono">Common questions</p>
